  "candidate": [
    "Dco renders Pco through qZ; qZ/Y5s/KV select cmdk Xyi and forward its command input.",
    "Pco input uses Qh(dialog.primaryAction,nativeEvent) before root fallback; matching prevents default/stops propagation and calls D(selectedPath,true).",
    "Qh import alias ca resolves to TQt; TQt resolves current nh overrides and exact Hfe/_Ut matching.",
    "Pco D requests diff only when the selected file has a change entry; this packet does not propose a change to that separate file-status contract.",
    "kI forwards onKeyDown to P6.Input/B5s, which spreads it onto a native input. Xyi skips default-prevented/composing events; otherwise Enter invokes the selected item, whose onSelect calls D(path) in edit mode.",
    "Current QuickOpenDialog ignores dialog.primaryAction overrides, delegating to hardcoded quickOpenKey(meta+Enter diff).",
    "Proposed narrow regression: default primary diff, custom logical/physical/additional primary diff, removed default falls back to file, plain Enter file unless itself configured primary, navigation/click/empty controls unchanged."
  ],
